{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：11:20 2026-09-25 HKT</p>\n\n<p>慈雲山毓華街23號慈雲山中心，今（25日）早上9時58分，一名女子致電報案，指其年約40多歲兒子情緒低落，報稱要跳樓自殺，警方及消防接報到場，在商場近一個球場找到男事主，他並無站過危險位置，由母親陪同送往伊利沙伯醫院檢查。</p>\n<img alt=\"事主(間條衫)被送院檢查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bc47360ae2de9041339644a0551a5c48/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-25_at_11_03_32.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a3a65e7bba6c2c54fc77efbbcf4cfc46/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-25_at_11_03_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防到場戒備。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ed315abc7582140e041a19cc16d97055/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-25_at_11_03_33_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9fa4db214b6544d63eace70e491e52d4/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-25_at_11_03_33.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e4cb8a3216c8a96103f38252accda659/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-25_at_11_03_32_2_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T03:38:07.379255+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}